        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor Reviewer as \&quot;Admin/authorized Operator\&quot;\n    participant UI as \&quot;Interface: UI\&quot;\n    participant API as \&quot;mainController: Controller\&quot;\n    participant App as \&quot;applicationService: Service\&quot;\n    participant DB as \&quot;PostgreSQL: Database\&quot;\n    Reviewer-&gt;&gt;UI: Open pending declaration\n    UI-&gt;&gt;+API: GET /api/v1/retailers/{id}\n    API-&gt;&gt;App: Get declaration within reviewer scope\n    App-&gt;&gt;+DB: Read profile, assessment and MLOR rules\n    DB--&gt;&gt;-App: Pending declaration\n    App--&gt;&gt;UI: Details and review data\n    Reviewer-&gt;&gt;UI: Approve or reject with reason\n    UI-&gt;&gt;+API: POST /api/v1/retailers/{id}/review\n    API-&gt;&gt;App: Review(decision, reason)\n    App-&gt;&gt;DB: Validate authority and current version\n    alt Approved\n        App-&gt;&gt;DB: Activate retailer and allocate business code\n        App-&gt;&gt;DB: Audit decision and notify permitted users\n        API--&gt;&gt;-UI: Approved\n    else Rejected\n        App-&gt;&gt;DB: Save rejection reason and audit\n        API--&gt;&gt;-UI: Rejected\n    end\n\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="fuIeqy0HcFxdssIgie7A-1">
